  "pages": [
    {
      "_id": "d3ef1a534c047716",
      "name": "About ship weapons",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Antiship missiles use Rigger 2's <strong>Extended Range Missile</strong> rules (Rigger 2 p.89). Besides Damage, Weight, Intelligence and Cost they carry vehicle ratings — Handling, a fixed Speed, Body (no Armor) and Signature — and a Range: the farthest the missile can fly. Ship weapons have no Availability or Street Index; the gamemaster sets them. <em>Cyberpirates p.179.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 100000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
      },
      "flags": {
        "sr2e-cyberpirates": {
          "source": {
            "page": 179,
            "cell": "Ship Weapons intro",
            "verified": "300dpi+visual"
          }
        }
      },
