    {
      "_id": "650ca3d8ff9bcedd",
      "name": "UGM-188 Sea Saber Antiship Missile",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The North American counterpart of the Sirocco (UCAS, Confederate and Royal Navy): shorter range, but faster, smarter and harder-hitting.</p><table><tr><th>Handling</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Speed</th><td>1,000</td></tr><tr><th>Range</th><td>250 km</td></tr><tr><th>Body</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Signature</th><td>5</td></tr><tr><th>Intelligence</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>24DN</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>900 kg</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>750,000¥</td></tr></table><p><em>Cyberpirates p.180.</em></p>"
      },
