    {
      "_id": "9021c066e5c6104f",
      "name": "Javelot Aerial Defense Missile",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>A French long-range air-defense missile against aircraft, antiship missiles and cruise missiles.</p><table><tr><th>Handling</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Speed</th><td>1,100</td></tr><tr><th>Range</th><td>120 km</td></tr><tr><th>Body</th><td>3</td></tr><tr><th>Signature</th><td>5</td></tr><tr><th>Intelligence</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>18D</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>495 kg</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>425,000¥</td></tr></table><p>It can also attack surface ships, at <strong>8MN</strong>.</p><p><em>Cyberpirates p.180.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 400000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
      },
