    {
      "_id": "3072f27856464bf2",
      "name": "Naval guns",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>Backup weapons against targets too small for antiship missiles, or against ships that lack them. Remote-operated with autoloaders; light naval guns can fire semi-automatic. Shells against normal targets do explosive damage under the Manual Gunnery or Indirect Fire rules (Rigger 2 p.56), Power −1 per 2 meters from the burst; the second Damage Code is ship damage. Weapon Value for turret space (Rigger 2 p.135): light 7, medium 10.</p>\n<table><tr><th></th><th>Light Naval Gun</th><th>Medium Naval Gun</th></tr>\n<tr><th>Type</th><td>Special</td><td>Special</td></tr><tr><th>Concealability</th><td>NA</td><td>NA</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Ammo</th><td>500</td><td>500</td></tr><tr><th>Mode</th><td>SA</td><td>SS</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Damage</th><td>20D / 8LN</td><td>25D / 11MN</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>250</td><td>600</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Cost</th><td>225,000¥</td><td>475,000¥</td></tr>\n<tr><th colspan=\"3\">Ammunition (per 100 shots): Concealability NA, damage as weapon</th></tr>\n<tr><th>Weight</th><td>2,500</td><td>7,500</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>8,000¥</td><td>15,000¥</td></tr></table>\n<table><tr><th>Range</th><th>Short</th><th>Medium</th><th>Long</th><th>Extreme</th></tr>\n<tr><th>Light</th><td>100–2,500 m</td><td>2.5–6 km</td><td>6–12 km</td><td>12–18 km</td></tr>\n<tr><th>Medium</th><td>100–4,000 m</td><td>4–12 km</td><td>12–18 km</td><td>18–25 km</td></tr></table>\n<p><em>Cyberpirates p.180–181.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 600000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
      },
      "flags": {
