    {
      "_id": "f2fee710f208f5aa",
      "name": "RUR-15D ASROC",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>A MADCAP strapped to a rocket: it flies 4–16 km, then the torpedo drops into the water and homes in.</p><table><tr><th>Handling</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Speed</th><td>Rocket 750; torpedo 115</td></tr><tr><th>Range</th><td>Rocket 16 km; torpedo 15 km from the splash point</td></tr><tr><th>Body</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Signature</th><td>5/5</td></tr><tr><th>Intelligence</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>14DN</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>2,250 kg (950 kg for the torpedo alone)</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>350,000¥</td></tr></table><p>The rocket stage is unguided: no Intelligence in flight, no rigger control after launch, and no blind fire at subs behind a thermocline.</p><p><em>Cyberpirates p.181.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 800000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
      },
