    {
      "_id": "492fc6ad0de02616",
      "name": "UIM-199 Kingfisher SSAM",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>A subsurface-to-air missile that lets a submerged sub kill dipping-sonar aircraft without surfacing; fired from a torpedo tube or a vertical-launch tube.</p><table><tr><th>Intelligence</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>14D</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>25 kg</td></tr><tr><th>Availability</th><td>14/21 days</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>15,000¥</td></tr><tr><th>Street Index</th><td>NA</td></tr><tr><th>Range</th><td>Short 20–100 m · Medium 101–220 m · Long 221–600 m · Extreme 601–2,200 m</td></tr></table><p>The sub must be at 50 m or shallower to launch; range counts from where the missile surfaces. Two fit in one vertical-launch tube.</p><p><em>Cyberpirates p.181.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 900000,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1
      },
