    {
      "_id": "e3f0cb5e59ed2729",
      "name": "Noisemaker",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>A meter-long perforated canister of chemicals that froths into a mass of bubbles, confusing sonar and torpedoes. When a sub releases one, other craft take <strong>+3 to all TNs</strong> to detect or target it for that Combat Turn and the next two (ten seconds).</p>\n<table><tr><th>Weight</th><td>75 kg</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>500¥</td></tr><tr><th>Availability</th><td>6/48 hours</td></tr><tr><th>Street Index</th><td>4.5</td></tr></table><p><em>Cyberpirates p.182.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 1100000,
