    {
      "_id": "7a92b2c6bfc73665",
      "name": "Decoy",
      "type": "text",
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>A torpedo body with a sound system that imitates a moving submarine.</p><table><tr><th>Handling</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Speed</th><td>150</td></tr><tr><th>Range</th><td>15 km (depth 750 meters)</td></tr><tr><th>Body</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Signature</th><td>5/3</td></tr><tr><th>Intelligence</th><td>2</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>NA</td></tr><tr><th>Sonar</th><td>4</td></tr><tr><th>Weight</th><td>950 kg</td></tr><tr><th>Cost</th><td>150,000¥</td></tr></table><p>When it deploys, every torpedo fired at the sub makes an <strong>Intelligence (6) Test</strong>: success, it stays locked on the sub; failure, it strikes the decoy.</p><p><em>Cyberpirates p.182.</em></p>"
      },
      "sort": 1200000,
